<p> V.V.S.Laxman b Klusener		  1</p>
<p> M.Azharuddin not out		    25</p>
<p> Extras (nb-5)				5</p>
<p> Total (for four wickets)		59</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-17 2-18 3-27 4-28</p>
<p>Bowling (to date): McMillan 10-6-8-0, Klusener 13-4-13-3 (5nb), Cronje 7-4-10-0, Symcox 6-1-28-1.</p>
